  "The Geo preview directly implements Web Mercator projection, visible-tile selection, fallback scaling, longitude wrapping, panning, zooming, click-to-coordinate conversion, and marker placement. It starts with a reusable SVG world overview and locally generated SVG tiles. OpenStreetMap raster tiles are requested only after the user selects that view and grants consent. No third-party mapping library is bundled.": "地理位置预览自行实现了 Web Mercator 投影、可见图块选择、备用图块缩放、经度环绕、平移和缩放、点击位置到坐标的转换以及标记放置。它首先显示可复用的 SVG 世界概览图，随后使用本地生成的 SVG 图块。只有当用户选择 OpenStreetMap 视图并明确同意后，应用才会请求其栅格图块。项目不捆绑任何第三方地图库。",
